Ember CLI Deploy is a deploy plugin for ember-cli that allows you to deploy your ember app to a variety of platforms.

## Installation

```sh
npm install --save-dev ember-cli-deploy
```

## Configuration

To configure ember-cli-deploy, add the following to your `ember-cli-build.js` file:

```javascript
var app = new EmberApp(defaults, {
  // Add options here
});
app.import('vendor/ember-cli-deploy/index.js');
```

Then, create a `.deployrc` file in the root of your project with the following format:

```json
{
  "environments": {
    "development": {
      "type": "local",
      "path": "dist"
    },
    "staging": {
      "type": "ftp",
      "host": "your.host.com",
      "user": "your-username",
      "password": "your-password",
      "path": "/path/to/deploy"
    },
